the knowledge base chapter 39 includes:

HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39 is published at "https://hts.usitc.gov/reststop/file?release=currentRelease&filename=Chapter%2039#page=3".
the text of HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39 is at "sources/hts/chapter_39.txt".
HTSUS Chapter 59 is published at "https://hts.usitc.gov/reststop/file?release=currentRelease&filename=Chapter%2059#page=1".
the text of HTSUS Chapter 59 is at "sources/hts/chapter_59.txt".

% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% What the model covers: the articles of plastics of the first prototype, and
% the goods of the chapter's families of products.
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

% the model covers manufactured articles of plastics
rule plastics_scope:
a good is a good the model describes
    if the good is a manufactured article.

% the model covers the primary forms, waste and semi-manufactures of Chapter 39
rule plastics_scope_family:
a good is a good the model describes
    if the family of the good is a family
    and the family is a family of plastics goods
    and it is not the case that
        the good is a manufactured article.

% a polymer whose form the ruling does not state
rule plastics_scope_polymer:
a good is a good the model describes
    if the polymer of the good is a polymer
    and it is not the case that
        the kind of the good is a kind
    and it is not the case that
        the good is a manufactured article.

primary form is a family of plastics goods, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "PRIMARY FORMS".
waste is a family of plastics goods, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Waste, parings and scrap, of plastics".
profile shape is a family of plastics goods, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "rods, sticks and profile shapes".
tube is a family of plastics goods, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Tubes, pipes and hoses and fittings therefor".
tube fitting is a family of plastics goods, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Tubes, pipes and hoses and fittings therefor".
floor covering is a family of plastics goods, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Floor coverings of plastics".
flat shape is a family of plastics goods, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "plates, sheets, film, foil and strip".
bath is a family of plastics goods, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Baths, shower baths, sinks and washbasins".
lavatory seat is a family of plastics goods, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Lavatory seats and covers".
sanitary ware is a family of plastics goods, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "similar sanitary ware, of plastics".
container is a family of plastics goods, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Reservoirs, tanks (including septic tanks), vats and similar containers".
door is a family of plastics goods, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Doors, windows and their frames and thresholds for doors".
blind is a family of plastics goods, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Shutters, blinds (including venetian blinds) and similar articles".
builders ware is a family of plastics goods, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Builders' ware of plastics".

% The kinds of goods of the chapter and their families (note 6: the primary
% forms; notes 8 to 11: tubes, wall coverings, flat shapes, builders' ware).
pellets falls in the family primary form, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "granules, flakes and similar bulk forms".
granules falls in the family primary form, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "granules, flakes and similar bulk forms".
flakes falls in the family primary form, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "granules, flakes and similar bulk forms".
powder falls in the family primary form, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "powders (including molding powders)".
lumps falls in the family primary form, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Blocks of irregular shape, lumps".
irregular block falls in the family primary form, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Blocks of irregular shape, lumps".
liquid falls in the family primary form, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Liquids and pastes, including dispersions (emulsions and suspensions) and solutions".
paste falls in the family primary form, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Liquids and pastes, including dispersions (emulsions and suspensions) and solutions".
dispersion falls in the family primary form, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Liquids and pastes, including dispersions (emulsions and suspensions) and solutions".
emulsion falls in the family primary form, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Liquids and pastes, including dispersions (emulsions and suspensions) and solutions".
suspension falls in the family primary form, as stated in HTSUS Section VII and Chapter 39, confer "Liquids and pastes, including dispersions (emulsions and suspensions) and solutions".
